    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The seasons",
     "texto": [
      "**春天**, **夏天**, **秋天** and **冬天** are spring, summer, fall and winter. **热** and **冷** describe heat and cold. You can say **冬天很冷** («it's very cold in winter»).",
      "Note: 天 appears in days and seasons, but it does not make every word mean «day» when translated."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
